<symbol type="2" id="99" code="415" name="Distinct cultivation boundary"><description>A boundary of symbol cultivated land vegetation (401, 412, 413, 414) or a permanent boundary between different types of cultivated land, when not shown with other symbols (fence, wall, path, etc.)
